<body><main>
<div class="top"><div class="brand">REALITY // WORLD SIMULATOR</div><div class="row" style="flex:0 1 auto"><span class="pill">UGX ECONOMY</span><span class="pill">CAREER · COMPETITION · LIFE</span><span class="pill">V2.0</span></div></div>
<h1>Build a life.<br>Compete with intelligence.</h1>
<p class="muted">A fictional but reality-grounded learning simulation. Build skills and a career across modern industries, compete against simulated AI rivals, manage money responsibly, and unlock homes and cars as your means grow.</p>
<div class="stats">
 <div class="stat"><b id="cash">UGX 500k</b><span>Available cash</span></div><div class="stat"><b id="xp">0</b><span>Learning XP</span></div><div class="stat"><b id="rep">10</b><span>Reputation</span></div><div class="stat"><b id="level">1</b><span>Level</span></div><div class="stat"><b id="well">70</b><span>Life balance</span></div><div class="stat"><b id="round">0/12</b><span>Turns played</span></div>
</div>
<div class="grid">
 <section class="panel span8">
  <div class="eyebrow">Your direction</div><h2>Choose a career path</h2>
  <div class="row"><div><label for="career">Career / professional track</label><select id="career"></select></div><div><label for="sector">Current sector focus</label><select id="sector"></select></div></div>
  <p class="small" id="careerInfo">Your career shapes the opportunities you encounter.</p>
  <div class="row"><button class="btn secondary" id="careerSet">Confirm direction</button><button class="btn secondary" id="rest">Take a balanced day</button></div>
 </section>
 <section class="panel span4">
  <div class="eyebrow">AI competition</div><h2>Rival agents</h2><p class="small">These are locally simulated competitors with different strategies—not connected to live AI services.</p><div id="agents"></div>
 </section>
 <section class="panel span8" id="missionPanel">
  <div class="eyebrow" id="missionMeta">Your next real-world challenge</div><h2 id="missionTitle">A new opportunity is waiting</h2>
  <div class="scenario" id="missionText">Choose your career direction, then begin your first turn.</div>
  <div class="tip" id="missionTip">Every scenario is designed to teach a transferable skill. Outcomes are illustrative, not financial or professional advice.</div>
  <div id="options"></div><div id="debrief" class="tip hidden"></div>
  <div class="row"><button class="btn" id="next" disabled>Next challenge</button><button class="btn secondary" id="start">Start / new challenge</button></div>
 </section>
 <section class="panel span4">
  <div class="eyebrow">Your development</div><h2>Skill profile</h2><div id="skills"></div>
  <div class="small">Scores are game indicators, not IQ or psychological measurements.</div>
 </section>
 <section class="panel span7">
  <div class="eyebrow">Lifestyle milestones</div><h2>Cars & homes</h2><p class="small">Unlock aspirational assets as milestones. Buying one reduces cash and adds ongoing costs; do not purchase beyond your means.</p>
  <div class="grid" style="margin-top:8px" id="assets"></div>
 </section>
 <section class="panel span5">
  <div class="eyebrow">Family & community intelligence</div><h2>Human side quests</h2><p class="small">Light, respectful scenarios about communication, shared responsibilities, listening and community. No invasive personal-life roleplay.</p>
  <button class="btn secondary" id="family">Play a family / community side quest</button><div id="familyResult" class="small" style="margin-top:10px"></div>
 </section>
 <section class="panel span12">
  <div class="eyebrow">World activity log</div><h2>What you've learned</h2><div class="feed" id="log"><div class="small">Your decisions and learning notes will appear here.</div></div>
 </section>
</div>
<p class="small" style="margin-top:18px">This is an offline prototype. Scenarios, rival actions, prices and progression are fictional game data. It does not connect to real employers, banks, markets, dealerships or property listings. Refreshing the page restarts the game.</p>
</main>
<div id="modal" class="modalback hidden"><div class="modal"><div class="eyebrow">Milestone purchase</div><h2 id="modalTitle"></h2><p id="modalText" class="muted"></p><div class="row"><button class="btn" id="buyConfirm">Confirm purchase</button><button class="btn secondary" id="buyCancel">Cancel</button></div></div></div>
